DFlash (https://github.com/z-lab/dflash)

The arithmetic of the draft model in Sources/SploshRuntime/DraftModel.swift
and Sources/Shaders/draft.metal follows dflash/model.py. DFlash is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose text is in LICENSE.


llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp)

The GGUF tensor formats, the arithmetic that makes a weight of a code, and the
IQ4_NL values and the IQ3_S grid (ggml's kvalues_iq4nl and iq3s_grid, from
ggml/src/ggml-common.h) in Sources/Shaders/gguf_formats.h,
Sources/SploshModel/GgufQuant.swift and tools/gguf_check.py follow ggml's
ggml/src/ggml-quants.c. The tables are compiled into the Metal library.

